  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><u><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/EM0013872_AnsExp1_1.jpg\" /></strong></u><br />Let us assume that after the collision, the velocity of the incoming ball changes from&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>u</mi></math>&nbsp;to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>u</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup></math>&nbsp;and the other two balls move in the opposite directions with the same speed&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi></math>, then</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>cos</mi><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>u</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>u</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>u</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>u</mi></math></p><p>For the ball attached to the string,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>sin</mi><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>v</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>v</mi></math></p><p>Eliminating&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>N</mi><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>t</mi></math>, we obtain</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>m</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>u</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>u</mi></math></p><p>Using the coefficient of restitution equation we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>v</mi><mi>cos</mi><mn>60</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>cos</mi><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><msup><mi>u</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>u</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mi>u</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mi>u</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mi>u</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac><mi>u</mi></math></p><p>The total impulse of tension is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>T</mi><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>u</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>u</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>T</mi><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>u</mi></mrow><mn>7</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>12</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac><mi>m</mi><mi>u</mi></math></p>",
